ause  they are safe the vision we have is that  we have built a system that  enable many many more patients to get  minimal access surgery and all the  benefits that that brings for them in  terms of reduce complications reduce  pain you know quicker return to work etc  and the the the aim is to put this  system is many hospitals worldwide as we  care it may seem hard to imagine but  this robot - and others alike might  possibly mean a difference between life  and death in operating theaters no  Philips Sky News
 

